    "detailed_description": "<strong>Tales of Fire</strong> is the story of a little ant on an adventure to save her village from the winter cold.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/a81785d388ae8a431d1a06acf11bb5ae.poster.avif?t=1728298131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/a81785d388ae8a431d1a06acf11bb5ae.webm?t=1728298131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/a81785d388ae8a431d1a06acf11bb5ae.mp4?t=1728298131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Explore the dangerous terrain with nothing but your match, aka your weapon. Make sure not to let the match extinguish though!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/a96d912da57d02808c713d0a57271f82.poster.avif?t=1728298131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/a96d912da57d02808c713d0a57271f82.webm?t=1728298131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/a96d912da57d02808c713d0a57271f82.mp4?t=1728298131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Will you be able to help all the ants survive? Make sure to bring the fire to the end and save all of the ant species!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/80c24729e97ad94e414adf194a2fdc46.poster.avif?t=1728298131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/80c24729e97ad94e414adf194a2fdc46.webm?t=1728298131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/80c24729e97ad94e414adf194a2fdc46.mp4?t=1728298131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Tales of Fire</strong> is the story of a little ant on an adventure to save her village from the winter cold.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/a81785d388ae8a431d1a06acf11bb5ae.poster.avif?t=1728298131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/a81785d388ae8a431d1a06acf11bb5ae.webm?t=1728298131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/a81785d388ae8a431d1a06acf11bb5ae.mp4?t=1728298131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Explore the dangerous terrain with nothing but your match, aka your weapon. Make sure not to let the match extinguish though!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/a96d912da57d02808c713d0a57271f82.poster.avif?t=1728298131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/a96d912da57d02808c713d0a57271f82.webm?t=1728298131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/a96d912da57d02808c713d0a57271f82.mp4?t=1728298131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Will you be able to help all the ants survive? Make sure to bring the fire to the end and save all of the ant species!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/80c24729e97ad94e414adf194a2fdc46.poster.avif?t=1728298131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/80c24729e97ad94e414adf194a2fdc46.webm?t=1728298131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950770/extras/80c24729e97ad94e414adf194a2fdc46.mp4?t=1728298131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Tales of Fire is a short story-driven game, embark on an adventure to bring fire to your ant village or else they all die to the cold winter breeze. Platform your way through mushrooms, escape from evil spiders and make friends along the way. Can you save them?",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe drawings are beautiful, the music fits the game well, the story is very good, the game has some easy stages and some very challenging ones, the way the levels were built caught my attention because they deviated a little from the standard of platform games, in short, this game is very good, I recommend it.\u201d<br>artur<br><br>\u201cWhile I played this game I felt like playing a fable. So beautiful art! I can only recommend it!\u201d<br>avnj<br><br>\u201cCute graphics, nice history, gameplay and great soundtrack!\u201d<br>BeSyde<br>",
